    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "1) Urban stormwater provides great potential to augment urban water supplies, but stormwater pollutants can cause groundwater contamination\r\n2) Different types and configurations of geomedia will be investigated to remove priority pollutants prior to groundwater recharge\r\n3) Objectives of this study: (a) develop geomedia-based stormwater treatment systems for reliable removal of pollutants, (b) identify design parameters and management criteria for full-scale stormwater harvesting projects",
